      "writtenOn": "2026-06-29T19:32:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With how `drawEdgeAAImageSet` is implemented, we don\u0027t really gain anything by pre-collecting all of the atlases entries so we could just create a stack allocated ImageSetEntry here and call `drawEdgeAAImageSet` with a count of 1 (similar to how `drawImageRect` does it).\n\nWhile we would be calling drawGeometry() directly in the fixed color case, I think it\u0027s still helpful to use drawEdgeAAImageSet here because it is handling a lot of the logic to create the SimpleImage override.",
